  "body": "This PR introduces a new set of experimental widgets:\r\n\r\n- `EXPERIMENTAL_configureRelatedItems`\r\n- `EXPERIMENTAL_connectConfigureRelatedItems`\r\n\r\nCombined with the `hits` component, these widgets allow to create related items experiences as seen in e-commerce and media use cases:\r\n\r\n![Example](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6137112/69717292-12bedf00-110c-11ea-9a47-8ddd7c8ed2a6.png)\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n\r\n<summary>See more examples</summary>\r\n\r\n![Example](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6137112/69970627-d54cbe00-151e-11ea-85bc-04304077f78e.png)\r\n\r\n![Example](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6270048/67220965-ff449800-f42a-11e9-9896-2db8adb9b786.png)\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n## Usage\r\n\r\nGiven this hit:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"name\": \"Amazon - Fire TV Stick with Alexa Voice Remote - Black\",\r\n  \"description\": \"Enjoy smart access to videos [...]\",\r\n  \"brand\": \"Amazon\",\r\n  \"categories\": [\"TV & Home Theater\", \"Streaming Media Players\"],\r\n  \"hierarchicalCategories\": {\r\n    \"lvl0\": \"TV & Home Theater\",\r\n    \"lvl1\": \"TV & Home Theater > Streaming Media Players\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"type\": \"Streaming media plyr\",\r\n  \"price\": 39.99,\r\n  \"price_range\": \"1 - 50\",\r\n  \"image\": \"https://cdn-demo.algolia.com/bestbuy-0118/5477500_sb.jpg\",\r\n  \"url\": \"https://api.bestbuy.com/click/-/5477500/pdp\",\r\n  \"free_shipping\": false,\r\n  \"rating\": 4,\r\n  \"popularity\": 21469,\r\n  \"objectID\": \"5477500\",\r\n  \"__position\": 1\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd these options:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconfigureRelatedItems({\r\n  hit,\r\n  matchingPatterns: {\r\n    brand: { score: 3 },\r\n    type: { score: 10 },\r\n    categories: { score: 2 },\r\n  },\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe following search parameters will be computed:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"facets\": [],\r\n  \"disjunctiveFacets\": [],\r\n  \"hierarchicalFacets\": [],\r\n  \"facetsRefinements\": {},\r\n  \"facetsExcludes\": {},\r\n  \"disjunctiveFacetsRefinements\": {},\r\n  \"numericRefinements\": {},\r\n  \"tagRefinements\": [],\r\n  \"hierarchicalFacetsRefinements\": {},\r\n  \"index\": \"instant_search\",\r\n  \"hitsPerPage\": 5,\r\n  \"sumOrFiltersScores\": true,\r\n  \"filters\": \"NOT objectID:5477500\",\r\n  \"optionalFilters\": [\r\n    [\"brand:Amazon<score=3>\"],\r\n    [\"type:Streaming media plyr<score=10>\"],\r\n    [\r\n      [\r\n        \"categories:TV & Home Theater<score=2>\",\r\n        \"categories:Streaming Media Players<score=2>\"\r\n      ]\r\n    ]\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n[Learn more about how scores work in Algolia →](https://www.algolia.com/doc/guides/managing-results/refine-results/merchandising-and-promoting/in-depth/optional-filter-scoring/)\r\n\r\nThe search parameters will then be set in the index to display related items with a `hits` widget.\r\n\r\n## Implementation\r\n\r\nSince this is an experimental widget, I didn't add logic in `connectConfigure` but rather created a connector called `connectConfigureRelatedItems` that Vue InstantSearch and Angular InstantSearch can rely on.\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\n[See story →](https://deploy-preview-4233--instantsearchjs.netlify.com/stories/?path=/story/basics-configurerelateditems--default)\r\n\r\n## Related\r\n\r\n- [RFC](https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch-rfcs/blob/7871af03c80cb6ab87c47d82cc8c1f78da0a5e51/accepted/related-items.md)",
